==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mŭl'-tə-plĭ-kăndʹ}}, {{IPA|/ˌmʌltəplɪˈkænd/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ænd|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|arithmetic|lang=en}} A number that is to be [[multiply|multiplied]] by another (the [[multiplier]]).
#: ''In the expression'' 5 × 7, ''the "7" is a '''multiplicand'''.''

